    },
    {
     "path": ".sections[1].dialogue[0].zh",
     "class": "NOT_FOUND",
     "sim": 0.0,
     "ref": null,
     "corpus": "師隨馬祖行次見野鴨子飛過祖曰是甚麼師曰野鴨子祖曰甚處去也師曰飛過去也",
     "ref_window": "",
     "simplified": []
    },
    {
     "path": ".sections[1].dialogue[1].zh",
     "class": "NOT_FOUND",
     "sim": 0.0,
     "ref": null,
     "corpus": "祖遂把師鼻頭猛捏師負痛失聲祖曰又道飛過去也師於言下大悟",
     "ref_window": "",
     "simplified": []
    },
    {
     "path": ".sections[2].title_zh",
     "class": "NOT_FOUND",
     "sim": 0.0,
     "ref": null,
     "corpus": "馬祖上堂百丈卷席",
     "ref_window": "",
     "simplified": [
