    {
     "path": ".sections[1].dialogue[0].zh",
     "class": "NOT_FOUND",
     "sim": 0.0,
     "ref": null,
     "corpus": "師示眾云汝等諸人盡是噇酒糟漢恁麼行腳何處有今日還知大唐國內無禪師麼",
     "ref_window": "",
     "simplified": []
    },
    {
     "path": ".sections[1].dialogue[1].zh",
     "class": "NOT_FOUND",
     "sim": 0.0,
     "ref": null,
     "corpus": "時有僧出問只如諸方聚眾接人又作麼生師曰不道無禪祇是無師",
     "ref_window": "",
     "simplified": []
    },
    {
     "path": ".sections[2].title_zh",
     "class": "NOT_FOUND",
     "sim": 0.0,
     "ref": null,
     "corpus": "虛空本無體心亦如虛空",
     "ref_window": "",
     "simplified": []
    },
    {
     "path": ".sections[2].dialogue[0].zh",
     "class": "NOT_FOUND",
